  --- clubs_associations tab response shape ---
  Capped at the first 10 active clubs (inline preview only) with a trimmed
  field set (id, name, category, cover_image, logo, about). For the full
  paginated + searchable list, use List Clubs & Associations. For a single
  club's full detail view (includes mission, key_activities, recent_events),
  use Get Club Detail.
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Club detail fetched successfully",
    "data": {
